{
    "background_story": "Aron was a member of the Polyergus breviceps colony, a species of ant known for their unique social structure. As a young ant, Aron was fascinated by the complex hierarchy of his colony. He spent countless hours observing the different castes, learning their roles and responsibilities. As he matured, Aron became increasingly drawn to the raids, where his colony would invade neighboring colonies to capture slaves. He proved to be a skilled and fearless raider, earning the respect of his peers. But Aron's true loyalty lay with his colony's queen, whom he protected with his life. When a rival colony threatened their nest, Aron led the defense, using his knowledge of Polyergus social structure to outmaneuver the attackers. His bravery and strategic thinking saved the colony, cementing his position as a hero among his kin.",
